{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hvs2NpVuMBFGJDryBxVaeG","type":"tool_result","content":"500\t\\item r1-32b precision: [0.498, 0.712]\n501\t\\item QwQ-32B temporal coverage: [0.419, 0.681]\n502\t\\item QwQ-32B pre-CP FPR: [0.091, 0.224]\n503\t\\item QwQ-32B precision: [0.479, 0.695]\n504\t\\end{itemize}\n505\t\n506\tThe wide per-model intervals motivate the pooled analysis; the consistent direction across models provides the statistical power that individual models lack.\n507\t\n508\t\\end{document}\n509\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ez6bRhwEYp1btsyVY5jscx","session_id":"5feb2154-bbc5-4d7e-891f-e50eada4cb93","uuid":"aa35043c-aec2-43aa-becc-dec1f6d739cd","timestamp":"2026-05-16T22:07:19.674Z"}
